  "content": "\n\n<h2>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/TathanDev/StarWarsPlanets-AdAstra/blob/1.20.4/images/banner.png?raw=true\" width=\"1500\" height=\"500\"></h2>\n<h2>探索星際大戰美麗而廣闊的宇宙！</h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">提供 Fabric <strong>與 (Neo)Forge</strong> 版本！</h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ad-astra\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/TathanDev/StarWarsPlanets-AdAstra/blob/1.20.4/images/ad_astra_badge.png?raw=true\" alt=\"需要 Ad Astra\" width=\"208\" height=\"80\"></a></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">可探索的行星：</span></h2>\n<h2>塔图因⏳</h2>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/568/602/tatooine.png\" width=\"855\" height=\"445\"></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>恩多&nbsp;🌲</h2>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/741/187/2023-10-08_14.png\" width=\"860\" height=\"452\"></h2>\n<h2>霍斯&nbsp;🧊</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/489/881/2022-08-25_12.png\" width=\"861\" height=\"439\"></p>\n<h2>穆斯塔法🔥</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/489/882/2022-08-24_20.png\" width=\"859\" height=\"438\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>行星很酷，但什麼更酷？光劍！</h2>\n<p>本模組包含大量光劍！</p>\n<p>支援語言&nbsp;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>法文&nbsp;</li>\n<li>英文</li>\n<li>德文 (感謝&nbsp;Grafjojo)</li>\n<li>韓文 (感謝 min_su_kim</li>\n<li>簡體中文 (感謝 mcxiangdon)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>您可以在您的模組整合包中使用此模組！<br><br>特別感謝：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Duchy（Jawa 模型）</li>\n<li>Lost Tapes（爆能槍模型）</li>\n<li>Neil17iss（負責構建）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><br>遇到問題 🤨？歡迎前往我的 Discord 伺服器或/並在 GitHub 上回報問題！<br>- Discord：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/nuDEYcFX4j\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/nuDEYcFX4j</a><br>- 問題回報：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/TathanDev/StarWarsPlanets-AdAstra/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/TathanDev/StarWarsPlanets-AdAstra/issues</a></p>",
